    {
      "subId": "600305",
      "subQuestName": "Look for a way forward",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60030501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60030501": {
            "id": "60030501",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "What the... Trespassers? Here? What's wrong with you people!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030502"
            ]
          },
          "60030502": {
            "id": "60030502",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "We're looking for The Doctor, and we understand he might be here. I see you're fleeing the facility...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030503"
            ]
          },
          "60030503": {
            "id": "60030503",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "Hah... You looking to settle a score with The Doctor? Good luck with that... I don't think you'll have many chances left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030504"
            ]
          },
          "60030504": {
            "id": "60030504",
            "speakerId": 1314,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Perhaps. But you might have a chance to live — if you start talking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030505"
            ]
          },
          "60030505": {
            "id": "60030505",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "...Two other harbingers had the same idea as you. They're already inside. But what good's it gonna do? The Doctor wouldn't do something like this unprepared...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030506"
            ]
          },
          "60030506": {
            "id": "60030506",
            "speakerId": 1316,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Hmm... Seems to me that you're not too thrilled about being his subordinate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030507"
            ]
          },
          "60030507": {
            "id": "60030507",
            "speakerId": 1316,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Also, is it just me, or do I sense monsters nearby? If you'd prefer their company to ours, that can easily be arranged.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030508"
            ]
          },
          "60030508": {
            "id": "60030508",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030509"
            ]
          },
          "60030509": {
            "id": "60030509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We need to know what The Doctor is up to. Please, if you know anything at all, tell me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030510"
            ]
          },
          "60030510": {
            "id": "60030510",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is about more than us versus The Doctor. His actions could have consequences for all of Nod-Krai — and perhaps even your homeland, Snezhnaya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030511"
            ]
          },
          "60030511": {
            "id": "60030511",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "...I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030512"
            ]
          },
          "60030512": {
            "id": "60030512",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "He's... building something — ambitious doesn't even begin to describe it. Feels like this could be the big one. God knows how long he's been planning it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030513"
            ]
          },
          "60030513": {
            "id": "60030513",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "A while back, he told us he'd be returning to Snezhnaya. We weren't expecting him back so soon... This time, he brought some gemstones with him, or something. Two of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030514"
            ]
          },
          "60030514": {
            "id": "60030514",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "...The Moon Marrow spheres. He stole them from their rightful owner, Columbina.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030515"
            ]
          },
          "60030515": {
            "id": "60030515",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "Oh... Lady Damselette? Last I heard, she left the Fatui. Before she went, she told us she'd finished what Her Majesty asked of her, and wished to focus on some personal matters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030516"
            ]
          },
          "60030516": {
            "id": "60030516",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "I remember thinking that leaving us might not be the best choice. I mean, I always looked up to The Captain the most, and...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030517"
            ]
          },
          "60030517": {
            "id": "60030517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030518"
            ]
          },
          "60030518": {
            "id": "60030518",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "Back when this all started, the higher-ups dispatched three units to Nod-Krai to execute their plan. They were led by The Doctor, Marionette, and The Damselette respectively.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030519"
            ]
          },
          "60030519": {
            "id": "60030519",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "I was part of the The Damselette's unit to begin with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030520"
            ]
          },
          "60030520": {
            "id": "60030520",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "She never interacted with us much. In fact, she seemed sorta... detached from everything. Not because she was distracted, it just felt like she was indifferent to the world around her. Like she had no stake in anything that happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030521"
            ]
          },
          "60030521": {
            "id": "60030521",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "She always seemed like she was staring off into the distance. Almost as if she didn't see anything worth living for in the present, so she had to look further afield... Ah, that's right — she always used to stare up at the sky.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030522"
            ]
          },
          "60030522": {
            "id": "60030522",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "The Doctor used to stand nearby and watch her. Apparently, they got along well at first. But somewhere along the way, she grew wary of him, and started avoiding him as much as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030523"
            ]
          },
          "60030523": {
            "id": "60030523",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "After she left, everyone in our unit merged with The Doctor's. He's... similarly indifferent to the world — except when it comes to the moons. He seems to have big plans for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030524"
            ]
          },
          "60030524": {
            "id": "60030524",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "Right now, obtaining the three moons is his number one priority. He even said... if he can only get his hands on two of them, he'll create a third one himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030525"
            ]
          },
          "60030525": {
            "id": "60030525",
            "speakerId": 1316,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "How would he create an artificial Moon Marrow? ...Maybe the knowledge he gained from the Hyperborean phantoms has something to do with it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030526"
            ]
          },
          "60030526": {
            "id": "60030526",
            "speakerId": 1314,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "Thank you for cooperating. We appreciate the level of detail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030527"
            ]
          },
          "60030527": {
            "id": "60030527",
            "speakerId": 1315,
            "speakerName": "Lauma",
            "text": "I get the sense that you'd serve under Columbina again if you had the chance. Would that be fair?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030528"
            ]
          },
          "60030528": {
            "id": "60030528",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "...No, she's no longer a harbinger. As a member of the Fatui, my loyalty will always belong to the Tsaritsa.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030529"
            ]
          },
          "60030529": {
            "id": "60030529",
            "speakerId": 16179,
            "speakerName": "Jotautas",
            "text": "I'm only telling you all this because I don't completely trust The Doctor. His actions do not align with the goals that first brought us to Nod-Krai.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030530"
            ]
          },
          "60030530": {
            "id": "60030530",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I understand. We'll do everything within our power to stop him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030531"
            ]
          },
          "60030531": {
            "id": "60030531",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Knave's unit is based at the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau. Maybe you can seek refuge with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030532"
            ]
          },
          "60030532": {
            "id": "60030532",
            "speakerId": 1316,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Well, now we know what's going on here. Artificial Moon Marrow... he's likely well on the way to completing it. Dottore's technological capabilities are far more advanced than I thought.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60030533"
            ]
          },
          "60030533": {
            "id": "60030533",
            "speakerId": 1314,
            "speakerName": "Flins",
            "text": "I fear this could get ugly. Everyone, prepare yourselves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
